  "prompt": "The pricing team is checking how closely the competitors watched the Soundbars range in the week of 10 to 16 March 2025. For each product in the Soundbars category (category_id 17), how many competitor price checks were made from 10 March 2025 to 16 March 2025, and what was the lowest price_eur any of those checks found? observed_ts holds the time of a check in UTC: count the checks on those UTC days, both days included. Include every Soundbars product: a product with no check that week shows 0 checks and a missing lowest price. Return four columns, in this order: product_id, product_name, n_checks, lowest_price_eur. Sort by n_checks from lowest to highest, then by product_id from low to high.",
